# Title: UAC Bypass Using IEInstal - Process
# ID: 80fc36aa-945e-4181-89f2-2f907ab6775d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-08-30
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
# Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using IEInstal.exe (UACMe 64)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((IntegrityLevel equals "High" OR IntegrityLevel equals "System" OR IntegrityLevel equals "S-1-16-16384" OR IntegrityLevel equals "S-1-16-12288") AND ParentImage="*\\ieinstal.exe" AND Image contains "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\" AND Image="*consent.exe")
